  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt 1/2 the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water(for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66beacaca0a75acc54a18032-c49efb6d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut capsicum into bite-sized pieces.\n• Thinly slice zucchini into half moons.\n• Drain and rinse black beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66beacaca0a75acc54a18032-ac89b0f7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook capsicum, zucchini and black beans, until tender, 4-6 mins.\n• Stir in Mexican seasoning, tomato paste, the brown sugar, and the remaining butter and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66beacaca0a75acc54a18032-805e2911.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add water (for the sauce) and vegetable stock powder. Reduce heat to low and simmer until slightly thickened, 3-4 mins. Season to taste.\n• Divide rice between bowls and top with black bean chilli. Top with sour cream and Cheddar cheese. Tear over coriander. Garnish with chilli flakes (if using).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66beacaca0a75acc54a18032-0a924bc8.jpeg"
    }
  ]
